[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……ここが、一番奥ですよね？\nお宝も、誰かの気配もなさそう……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...This is the very back, isn't it? No treasure, and no sign of anyone..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "シャリステラ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Shallistera"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……残念だけど、何もないみたいね。\nさっき戦った魔物も、伝承とは関係なさそうだったし",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Looks like there's nothing here. And that monster we fought earlier didn't seem to have anything to do with the legend either."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Miruca"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ウソー！\u3000劇にもなってる伝承なのに！\u3000\n宝箱のひとつもないなんて、拍子抜けだよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "No way! It made it into a play and everything! Not even a single treasure chest? What a letdown."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "シャルロッテ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Shallotte"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "伝承ってそういうものよ。嘘であれ真であれ、\n語り継がれるうちに、どんどん大きくなるもの",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That's how legends work. True or false, the more they're passed down, the bigger they get."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユリエ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jurie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そっか……残念",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I guess... Still disappointing."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "シャルロッテ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Shallotte"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それに……これは私の推測だけど、\nここには元々、お宝なんてなかったのかもしれない",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "And... this is just my theory, but maybe there was never any treasure here to begin with."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユリエ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jurie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "え？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Huh?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "シャルロッテ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Shallotte"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "伝承は、ここまでの道筋を示すようなものだった。\n竜の牙も含めてね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The legend read more like directions to this place. Right down to the dragon's fangs."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユリエ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jurie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "伝わる人には伝わる、暗号のような筆致だった。\n……恐らくこれは、この場所への秘密の暗号だったのよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Written like a cipher — only meaningful to those who knew what to look for. ...I think this was someone's secret code. A way to find this spot."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユリエ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jurie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "友人か、恋人か……詳しいことは分からないけれど、\nきっと誰かが秘密の場所として使っていたのかもね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "A friend, a lover... I couldn't say for certain. But someone must have used this as their own private hideaway."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユリエ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jurie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "わぁ……だとしたら、なんだか素敵ですね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh... if that's true, that's actually kind of wonderful."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "シャリステラ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Shallistera"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うん、そうね……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes... it is."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユリエ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jurie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ねぇ、見て。この地面、普通の岩じゃない。\n希少な鉱石が混じってる",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hey, look at this. The ground here isn't ordinary rock. There are rare minerals mixed in."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Miruca"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "こっちの水草も、陸じゃ見たことない種類。\n錬金術の素材に使えそう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "And these aquatic plants — I've never seen this variety on land. They could work as alchemy materials."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Miruca"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "わっ、ほんと！？\u3000さっすがミルカ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Whoa, really?! Nice eye, Miruca!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "シャルロッテ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Shallotte"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふふ、ミルカさん、目が輝いてる",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hehe, your eyes are practically sparkling, Miruca."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "シャリステラ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Shallistera"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……シャリー、うるさい",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Quiet, Shallie."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Miruca"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふふ、みんな楽しそうね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heh. Seems like everyone's having fun."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユリエ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jurie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……ここは素材の宝庫ね。\n採取したいものが、たくさん",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...This place is a treasure trove of materials. There's so much I want to collect."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Miruca"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ねえ、あたしも採取する！\u3000\nどれが一番すごい素材？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ooh, let me help gather some! Which ones are the best?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "シャルロッテ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Shallotte"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "その青い結晶、触らないで。\n壊れやすいから",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Don't touch those blue crystals. They're fragile."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Miruca"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あっ、ごめんごめん！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh — sorry, sorry!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "シャルロッテ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Shallotte"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "…………",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユリエ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jurie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ユリエさん、紀行文のメモですか？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Are you taking notes for your journal?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "シャリステラ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Shallistera"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ええ……伝承のお宝はなかったけれど、\nここに来た価値は十分にあったわ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I am... There may not have been any treasure, but this trip was more than worth it."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユリエ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jurie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……姉さん、私のことは書いてないでしょうね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...You're not writing about me, are you."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Miruca"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あら、ダメかしら。\nあなたたちと一緒に来た記録も、きっと誰かの役に立つ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "And why not? A record of this journey — all of us together — could mean something to someone someday."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユリエ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jurie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あたしのことも書いてよ！\u3000\n「伝承のお宝\u3000探し隊」とか、かっこよく書いてね！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Write about me too! Something cool, like — 'The Legendary Treasure Hunters' or whatever!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "シャルロッテ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Shallotte"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふふ、考えておくわ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hehe. I'll think about it."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユリエ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jurie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……これだけ集まれば十分。\n思いがけず、いい素材に出会えた",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...This should be enough. We found better materials than I expected."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Miruca"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ミルカさん、その素材で\n何を作るか決まってるんですか？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Do you already have something in mind to make with them?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "シャリステラ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Shallistera"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ええ、そうね……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Miruca"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "…………",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Miruca"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 33,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ミルカ、どうかした？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Miruca? Something on your mind?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユリエ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jurie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 34,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "いいえ、何も",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "No. Nothing."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Miruca"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 35,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "何を調合するにせよ、手が必要だったら呼んでね！\n手伝うよ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Whatever you end up making, call us if you need extra hands! We'll pitch in!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "シャルロッテ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Shallotte"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 36,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "わたしもお手伝いします！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'll help too!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "シャリステラ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Shallistera"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 37,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うん。二人とも、ありがとう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah. Thank you both."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Miruca"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]